# Day 004 - Loops + Number Guessing Game

## Loops

| Loop | Use when |
|------|----------|
| for | Number of iterations is known |
| while | Condition checked before running |
| do-while | Must run at least once |

java
for (int i = 1; i <= 5; i++) { System.out.println(i); }

int n = 5;
while (n > 0) { n--; }

do { System.out.println("Run once"); } while (false);


## break and continue

- break: exits the loop.
- continue: skips the current iteration.

## Nested Loop (Pattern)

java
for (int i = 1; i <= 5; i++) {
    for (int j = 1; j <= i; j++) System.out.print("* ");
    System.out.println();
}


